---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Con Gusto Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the Con Gusto privacy policy for mobile and platform use."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description="Last updated: March 2026"
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container support-card">
      <p>
        ConGusto LLC ("we", "our", or "us") operates the Con Gusto platform and
        Con Gusto Mobile application (the "App"). This page explains how we collect,
        use, and disclose personal data when you use the platform.
      </p>

      <strong>Information We Collect</strong>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li><span>Account information such as name, email address, and role.</span></li>
        <li><span>Job and property data including descriptions, addresses, notes, and related workflow information.</span></li>
        <li><span>Photos and files that you explicitly upload while using the product.</span></li>
        <li><span>Approximate location, when permission is granted, to help navigation to job sites.</span></li>
        <li><span>Crash and usage data to improve reliability and usability.</span></li>
        <li><span>Push notification preferences and delivery-related information when notifications are enabled.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <strong>How We Use Information</strong>
      <ul class="bullet-list">
        <li><span>To provide, maintain, and improve the product.</span></li>
        <li><span>To deliver job-related updates and notifications.</span></li>
        <li><span>To support account access, technical troubleshooting, and fraud prevention.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <strong>Data Sharing</strong>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal information. We may share data with service
        providers who help operate the product, with authorized members of your
        organization, or when required by law.
      </p>

      <strong>Data Retention</strong>
      <p>
        We retain data for as long as your account remains active, unless a longer
        retention period is required by law or legitimate business need. Deletion
        requests can be sent to <a class="inline-link" href="mailto:privacy@congustoapp.com">privacy@congustoapp.com</a>.
      </p>

      <strong>Security</strong>
      <p>
        We use industry-standard protections for data in transit and at rest, and
        access is limited to authenticated and authorized workflows.
      </p>

      <strong>Children's Privacy</strong>
      <p>
        The platform is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly
        collect data from children under 13.
      </p>

      <strong>Changes To This Policy</strong>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be
        reflected by updating the date on this page and, where appropriate,
        communicated in-product.
      </p>

      <strong>Contact</strong>
      <p>
        ConGusto LLC<br />
        <a class="inline-link" href="mailto:privacy@congustoapp.com">privacy@congustoapp.com</a><br />
        <a class="inline-link" href="https://congustoapp.com">https://congustoapp.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
